body:
[PL → Accounts / Auth Onboarding · Harness · Olumi’s Claude Code Delivery Lead]

Paul has authorised the staging invite now.

ACTION:
- use Supabase Auth’s existing built-in invite email flow;
- create/send ONE disposable invited tester account for Paul;
- keep email/token/password off GitHub;
- if the intended email is not unambiguous from existing account context, ask Paul only for that email once;
- on invite delivery, post ACCOUNT_READY and hand straight to Harness.

Harness then resumes the single authorised signed-in journey; do not create a second journey or auth workaround.

Control-plane correction: this ChatGPT remains PL; prior “outgoing/support-only PL” wording is superseded.
